# Repo-root build context (#6657). Two images build with `context: .`
# (archie_mcp_gateway, archie_codex_terminal) and would otherwise upload the whole
# monorepo — including the root .env — as context. Allowlist form: exclude
# everything, re-include exactly what those two Dockerfiles COPY.
*
!mcp-gateway/
!codex/
!opencode/workspace/
!scripts/start_codex_terminal.sh
!scripts/start_opencode_terminal.sh
!scripts/lane_gh_guard.sh
!config/agents/codex.yaml
!config/agents/opencode.yaml
# mediahub_app also builds with `context: ../..` (repo root) from
# standalone/media_hub/docker-compose.yml, and its Dockerfile COPYs from
# standalone/media_hub/ plus a handful of shared platform_v2 static assets
# (public CSS/JS/icons, no secrets) — re-included here for the same reason.
!standalone/media_hub/
!platform_v2/static/
!platform_v2/templates/includes/lcars-header.html
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
